---

---

<section
  id="about"
  class="bg-background pb-24 lg:pb-32 border-t border-white/5 pt-24"
>
  <div
    class="px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-24 flex flex-col items-center max-w-360 2xl:max-w-450 3xl:max-w-550 mx-auto"
  >
    <!-- Image banner -->
    <div
      class="relative aspect-21/9 lg:aspect-3/1 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-[2.5rem] mb-16 bg-white/5 border border-white/5 shadow-inner flex items-center justify-center p-8"
    >
      <div class="text-center">
        <span
          class="text-white/10 font-serif italic text-4xl sm:text-6xl tracking-widest font-thin block select-none"
          >VISIONEMA.NET</span
        >
        <span
          class="text-xs uppercase tracking-widest font-mono text-accent mt-2 block font-bold"
          >START • GROW • WIN</span
        >
      </div>
    </div>

    <h2
      class="text-[clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem)] font-extrabold leading-[1.4] tracking-tight text-center mx-auto text-foreground max-w-4xl"
    >
      Di Visionema.net, kami membantu bisnis Anda memikat audiens lewat konten
      visual estetik, penulisan skrip terarah, dan manajemen media sosial yang
      terintegrasi.
    </h2>
    <a
      class="inline-flex items-center justify-center mt-10 px-8 py-4 rounded-full bg-white text-background text-lg tracking-tight font-bold hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 transition-transform duration-300"
      href="#contact"
    >
      Pelajari Selengkapnya
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="social-proof" class="bg-background py-24 border-t border-white/5">
  <div
    class="px-6 sm:px-12 lg:px-24 max-w-360 2xl:max-w-450 3xl:max-w-550 mx-auto"
  >
    <div
      class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between mb-16 gap-6"
    >
      <h2
        class="text-3xl lg:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-foreground"
      >
        Dipercaya oleh berbagai brand
      </h2>
      <a
        class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-accent text-white text-sm font-bold hover:opacity-95 transition-opacity"
        href="#contact"
      >
        Mulai Menang Bareng
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- Layout Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6">
      <!-- Card 1: Testimonial -->
      <div
        class="lg:col-span-2 bg-white/5 border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[320px]"
      >
        <div>
          <!-- Quote Icon -->
          <svg
            class="w-10 h-10 text-white/10 mb-6"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="currentColor"
          >
            <path
              d="M4.583 17.321C3.553 16.227 3 15 3 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.335 1.804-3.987 4.145-4.247 5.621.537-.278 1.24-.375 1.929-.311 1.804.167 3.226 1.648 3.226 3.489a3.5 3.5 0 01-3.5 3.5c-1.073 0-2.099-.49-2.748-1.179zm10 0C13.553 16.227 13 15 13 13.011c0-3.5 2.457-6.637 6.03-8.188l.893 1.378c-3.335 1.804-3.987 4.145-4.247 5.621.537-.278 1.24-.375 1.929-.311 1.804.167 3.226 1.648 3.226 3.489a3.5 3.5 0 01-3.5 3.5c-1.073 0-2.099-.49-2.748-1.179z"
            ></path>
          </svg>
          <blockquote
            class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold leading-snug text-foreground/90"
          >
            Pengerjaan kontennya sangat rapi dan estetik, Visionema benar-benar
            paham bagaimana membuat brand kami dinilai premium oleh audiens.
          </blockquote>
        </div>
        <div
          class="mt-8 flex items-center justify-between border-t border-white/5 pt-6"
        >
          <div>
            <p class="font-bold text-foreground text-base">Faisal R.</p>
            <p class="text-sm text-foreground/60">Pendiri, Local Apparel</p>
          </div>
          <span class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight opacity-40"
            >apparel.co</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Stat -->
      <div
        class="bg-white/5 border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
            3x Lebih
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm text-foreground/60 mt-2">
            Konsistensi Posting & Konten
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between mt-auto pt-6 border-t border-white/5"
        >
          <span
            class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider font-mono opacity-50"
            >KONSISTENSI</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 3: Stat -->
      <div
        class="bg-white/5 border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">+280%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-foreground/60 mt-2">
            Interaksi & Engagement Rate
          </p>
        </div>
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between mt-auto pt-6 border-t border-white/5"
        >
          <span
            class="text-sm font-semibold tracking-wider font-mono opacity-50"
            >INTERAKSI</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Ranking -->
      <div
        class="bg-white/5 border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-8 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[220px]"
      >
        <div>
          <p class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">100%</p>
          <p class="text-sm text-foreground/60 mt-2">
            Peduli Terhadap Brand Value Anda
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-auto pt-6 border-t border-white/5">
          <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-accent">
            Bukan Sekadar Posting Konten
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Case Summary -->
      <div
        class="lg:col-span-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/5 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-[200px]"
      >
        <p
          class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold leading-relaxed text-foreground/90"
        >
          Kami mendesain ulang strategi visual @visionema_net di Instagram demi
          memperlihatkan dedikasi kami pada efisiensi, kreativitas adaptif, dan
          stabilitas branding.
        </p>
        <div
          class="flex items-center justify-between mt-8 border-t border-white/5 pt-6"
        >
          <span class="text-lg font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-mono"
            >@visionema_net</span
          >
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
